
## run a openwrt docker
```
docker run --name openwrt --privileged \
-v ./openwrt-rootfs/bin:/bin \
-v ./openwrt-rootfs/sbin:/sbin \
-v ./openwrt-rootfs/lib:/lib \
-v ./openwrt-rootfs/usr:/usr \
-v ./openwrt-rootfs/etc:/etc \
-v ./openwrt-rootfs/www:/www \
-v ./openwrt-rootfs/root:/root \
hnkeyang/openwrt-empty:latest \
/sbin/init
```
